1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,690
据报道，老干妈挑辣椒的工人，
Reportedly, Laoganma's chili sorters

2
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:05,030
从六百多人变成了四十八人。
went from over six hundred to forty-eight.

3
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:08,350
顶替他们的，是传送带上方的高速相机，
Replacing them: high-speed cameras over the belt,

4
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:10,120
每零点三秒扫一遍。
scanning every 0.3 seconds.

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,140
据报道，挑出来的坏辣椒，
Reportedly, the bad chilies

6
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:14,280
是被一股气流直接吹走的。
are simply blown away by a jet of air.

7
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,260
公司回应：裁员传闻不实，
The company says the layoff rumor is false,

8
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:18,700
而且从来没用过这么多拣椒工。
and it never had that many sorters.

9
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,590
人数之争我们先放一边，
Let's leave the head count aside

10
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:22,610
今天只问一个烧脑问题：
and ask one brain-teaser:

11
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:24,570
一台机器，从没吃过辣椒，
A machine that has never tasted a chili —

12
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:26,810
凭什么一眼看出哪颗是坏的？
how does it spot a bad one at a glance?

13
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:28,560
第一步，先说个秘密：
First, a secret:

14
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,950
在相机眼里，根本没有辣椒。
to a camera, there is no chili.

15
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:33,290
只有几百万个小格子，叫像素，
Only millions of tiny squares called pixels,

16
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:36,090
每一格，就是三个数：红、绿、蓝。
each just three numbers: red, green, blue.

17
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:38,510
你的手机屏幕也是这么拼出来的，
Your phone screen works the same way:

18
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:40,730
凑近看，全是红绿蓝的小点。
up close, it's all red, green and blue dots.

19
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:43,120
好辣椒的格子，红的数很大，
Good chili pixels: big red,

20
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:44,540
绿和蓝都很小。
small green and blue.

21
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,790
霉斑、黑斑呢？
Mold and black spots?

22
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:48,250
三个数都很小，黑乎乎一片。
All three numbers small. Dark.

23
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:50,890
有的分拣机还看人眼看不见的光，
Some sorters even see light our eyes can't,

24
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:53,300
有些毛病在那种光下更显眼。
where some flaws stand out more.

25
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:55,860
最笨的办法：数一数黑格子，
The dumbest method: count dark pixels;

26
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:58,350
超过一定数量，就判它坏。
too many, and it's bad.

27
00:00:58,350 --> 00:00:59,030
反转一：
Twist one:

28
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:00,510
这招很快就翻车。
that trick breaks fast.

29
00:01:00,510 --> 00:01:03,360
辣椒的影子是黑的，蒂把也是深色的，
Shadows are dark. Stems are dark.

30
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:05,160
一颗好椒也会被冤枉。
A perfectly good chili gets framed.

31
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:06,580
所以现在用AI：
So now we use AI:

32
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:09,180
给它看成千上万张标好的照片。
show it thousands of labeled photos.

33
00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:10,530
这叫监督学习：
That's called supervised learning:

34
00:01:10,530 --> 00:01:13,170
人先把答案标好，它照着学。
people label the answers, and it learns from them.

35
00:01:13,170 --> 00:01:14,520
这张好，那张坏，
This one good, that one bad,

36
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:16,850
它自己琢磨出霉斑长什么样。
and it works out what mold looks like.

37
00:01:16,850 --> 00:01:18,360
就像老师傅带徒弟：
Like a master training an apprentice:

38
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:20,670
不讲规则，只让你看一万颗。
no rules, just look at ten thousand.

39
00:01:20,670 --> 00:01:22,520
徒弟看多了就有了手感，
Look long enough and you get a feel.

40
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:25,500
AI的手感，就是一大堆调好的数字。
An AI's feel is a pile of tuned numbers.

41
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:27,180
反转二，最反直觉：
Twist two, the weird one:

42
00:01:27,180 --> 00:01:29,730
看出来不难，难的是追上它。
spotting is easy. Catching is hard.

43
00:01:29,730 --> 00:01:31,090
传送带一直在跑，
The belt never stops.

44
00:01:31,090 --> 00:01:33,760
等算完，那颗辣椒已经往前走了。
By the time the math is done, the chili has moved.

45
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:34,930
这就像接球：
It's like catching a ball:

46
00:01:34,930 --> 00:01:38,170
你不是追着球跑，是先猜它落在哪。
you don't chase it, you guess where it will land.

47
00:01:38,170 --> 00:01:40,770
所以机器要算准：它现在在哪，
So the machine works out where it is now,

48
00:01:40,770 --> 00:01:42,760
几分之一秒后会到哪。
and where it'll be a split second later.

49
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:45,020
到了那一点，一个小喷嘴，
At that spot, a tiny nozzle

50
00:01:45,020 --> 00:01:46,460
噗，吹一口气。
goes pfft: one puff of air.

51
00:01:46,460 --> 00:01:49,400
色选机的喷气阀，开关只要几毫秒，
A sorter's air valve opens in a few milliseconds,

52
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,360
比眨一下眼快几十倍。
dozens of times faster than a blink.

53
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:53,940
坏辣椒被吹飞，掉进废料槽，
The bad chili flies into the reject bin;

54
00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:55,850
好辣椒继续往前走。
the good ones roll on.

55
00:01:55,850 --> 00:01:57,980
据报道，从看见到吹走，
Reportedly, from spotted to blown away

56
00:01:57,980 --> 00:01:59,840
也就零点三秒左右。
takes about 0.3 seconds.

57
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:02,640
吹早了吹到邻居，吹晚了吹个空，
Too early hits the neighbor, too late hits air.

58
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,250
这是一道物理题。
It's a physics problem.

59
00:02:04,250 --> 00:02:06,300
假如传送带每秒走一米，
If the belt moves one meter a second,

60
00:02:06,300 --> 00:02:08,830
晚百分之一秒，就偏一厘米。
a hundredth of a second late is a centimeter off.

61
00:02:08,830 --> 00:02:09,520
反转三：
Twist three:

62
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:11,860
机器看得见，不等于看得懂。
seeing isn't understanding.

63
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:13,630
颜色怪、其实没坏的，
Odd color but perfectly fine?

64
00:02:13,630 --> 00:02:14,810
它可能吹掉。
It might blow it away.

65
00:02:14,810 --> 00:02:16,860
坏在里面、外面看不出的，
Rotten inside, clean outside?

66
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:18,010
它可能放过。
It might let it pass.

67
00:02:18,010 --> 00:02:20,290
所以还留着四十八位老师傅，
That's why forty-eight experienced workers remain

68
00:02:20,290 --> 00:02:21,640
守最后一道关。
on the final check.

69
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:23,820
据报道，关键工序的不良率，
Reportedly, the defect rate at the key step

70
00:02:23,820 --> 00:02:25,280
降到了万分之二。
fell to 0.02 percent.

71
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,680
友情提示：这是公司说的数字，
Fine print: that's the company's figure,

72
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,680
不是食品安全抽检结果。
not a food safety test result.

73
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:32,110
人数怎么变的，各方说法不一，
Accounts of the head count differ;

74
00:02:32,110 --> 00:02:33,970
我们只讲机器怎么看。
we only explain how the machine sees.

75
00:02:33,970 --> 00:02:37,950
同样的办法，早就用在挑米、挑豆、挑茶叶，
The same trick sorts rice, beans and tea,

76
00:02:37,950 --> 00:02:40,060
也帮机器人分拣快递。
and helps robots sort parcels.

77
00:02:40,060 --> 00:02:43,210
机器人学里，这叫感知、决策、执行：
In robotics it's called sense, think, act:

78
00:02:43,210 --> 00:02:45,000
看见、算好、出手。
see it, work it out, make the move.

79
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,210
所以答案是：机器不懂辣，
So the answer: the machine knows nothing about spice.

80
00:02:47,210 --> 00:02:49,730
它只认得三个数，和一口气。
Just three numbers, and one puff of air.

81
00:02:49,730 --> 00:02:52,290
下次你吃到一瓶没有坏椒的辣酱，
Next time your chili sauce has no bad chili,

82
00:02:52,290 --> 00:02:54,180
记得谢谢那一口气。
thank that puff of air.

